{"3644010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zjawa: Bloodstained Soul", "steam_appid": 3644010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/d858b90fb7098a8437e417aecf68ae50.avif?t=1786981317\" width=538 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fear not Brother, tonight we are without sin. In Crusade all is forgiven.&quot; <br>It is 13th century, and seeds of heresy sprout in the west.  <br>By the grace of Pope, all who take up arms against this evil shall have eternal salvation. <br>Or so you were told. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zjawa: Bloodstained Soul is a Survival Horror RPG with a unique Timed-Turn Combat System, traverse eerie woods, grim churches and desolate town, gather items and kill or avoid macabre creatures standing in your way, your holy mission. Death is inevitable, but each is but a step towards final victory. For better or for worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/cbf151476b7f0bb2f25f816c48ba57d0.poster.avif?t=1786981317\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/cbf151476b7f0bb2f25f816c48ba57d0.webm?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/cbf151476b7f0bb2f25f816c48ba57d0.mp4?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/ef973e6c1e3ea1852cb6d5438ad30792.avif?t=1786981317\" width=538 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and opressive atmosphere,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Timed-Turn Combat System - Make all your moves in time, or lose your chance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multi-stage boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Macabre monster design,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource Management,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seamless world - Entering buildings does not transfer you to different location,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/75c6d02596ac8efdc67485084de078ce.poster.avif?t=1786981317\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/75c6d02596ac8efdc67485084de078ce.webm?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/75c6d02596ac8efdc67485084de078ce.mp4?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/d858b90fb7098a8437e417aecf68ae50.avif?t=1786981317\" width=538 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fear not Brother, tonight we are without sin. In Crusade all is forgiven.&quot; <br>It is 13th century, and seeds of heresy sprout in the west.  <br>By the grace of Pope, all who take up arms against this evil shall have eternal salvation. <br>Or so you were told. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zjawa: Bloodstained Soul is a Survival Horror RPG with a unique Timed-Turn Combat System, traverse eerie woods, grim churches and desolate town, gather items and kill or avoid macabre creatures standing in your way, your holy mission. Death is inevitable, but each is but a step towards final victory. For better or for worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/cbf151476b7f0bb2f25f816c48ba57d0.poster.avif?t=1786981317\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/cbf151476b7f0bb2f25f816c48ba57d0.webm?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/cbf151476b7f0bb2f25f816c48ba57d0.mp4?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/ef973e6c1e3ea1852cb6d5438ad30792.avif?t=1786981317\" width=538 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and opressive atmosphere,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Timed-Turn Combat System - Make all your moves in time, or lose your chance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multi-stage boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Macabre monster design,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource Management,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seamless world - Entering buildings does not transfer you to different location,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/75c6d02596ac8efdc67485084de078ce.poster.avif?t=1786981317\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/75c6d02596ac8efdc67485084de078ce.webm?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/75c6d02596ac8efdc67485084de078ce.mp4?t=1786981317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Zjawa: Bloodstained Soul is a 2D Survival Horror RPG mixing turn-based combat with real-time elements and hand-drawn art, set in 13th century France during a crusade against heresy. Slash, parry, and collect items to survive to see the end, whatever it may be. Find absolution or damnation.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/e1c6d1fe3a9cad7ecb017092b1cc357211e7cdaf/header.jpg?t=1786981317", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/bd6e350cf94758d1543974fd6fa3b722639bc1d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786981317", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/bd6e350cf94758d1543974fd6fa3b722639bc1d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786981317", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Direct3D 12 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Direct3D 12 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><str